#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:5
msgid "Is there any upload file size limit for the File Uploader module?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:6
msgid "No, using the File Uploader module you can upload unlimited size of files to your Google Drive."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:8
msgid "Is the files uploaded directly to Google Drive?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:9
msgid "Yes, the files directly uploaded to the Google Drive and doesn't affect your server storage or performance."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:12
msgid "Can the users share the files using the file links or through email?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:13
msgid "Yes, Users can share the files links via Direct File link, Email, Facebook, Twitter, and Whatsapp, and also can get embed code to share the file on a web page."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:16
msgid "Can I link a Google Drive folder to a user on my site when they have been registered?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:17
msgid "Yes, you can link a Google Drive folder to a user on your site when they have been registered. You can also link the private folders to the users manually."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:20
msgid "Can I use multiple Google Drive accounts?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:21
msgid "Yes, you can link to multiple Google Drive accounts to Integrate Google Drive plugin."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:24
msgid "Are there any usage limits?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:25
msgid ""
"There are no bandwidth or file size issues for your web host. If you want to stream any media files (Audio, Video), the files will be streamed directly from Google Drive.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"But, when any zip file will be downloaded, these will be downloaded through your site and can generate some traffic."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:30
msgid "Documents preview not working?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:31
msgid ""
"In order to preview documents, the files should have the sharing permission \"Anyone with link can view\". The plugin will automatically change the sharing permission.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"However, in some case the plugin isn't able to manage the sharing permissions even with those setting enabled. In that case, please try to set the sharing permissions manually via the native Google Drive interface."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:36
msgid "How can I insert direct Audio/ Video/ Image files to my page/ post?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:37
msgid ""
"To insert any Audio/ Video/ Image files to your page/ post, you have to use the Embed module. You can use the shortcode builder, classic editor, gutenberg editor, elementor or divi page builder to create and display the embed module.\n"
"<br><br>\n"
"You just have to enable the \"Direct Media Display\" option from the \"Advanced\" tab, which allows media files to be displayed directly instead of through the embedded player. You can do this while configuring the Embed module."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:42
msgid "Why is the embedded video/audio not working?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:43
msgid "Sometimes, embedded audio and video files may not play properly. To fix this issue, enable the \"Direct Media Display\" option from the \"Advanced\" tab, which allows media files to be displayed directly instead of through the embedded player. You can do this while configuring the Embed module."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:46
msgid "Why search module search results are slow?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:47
msgid "The search module search results may take some time to show the search results. The time depends on the number of files that are selected for the search module. If your selected folders for the search module have a lot of children files then the search module search results may take some time to show the search results."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:50
msgid "Can I allow my clients to use the \"Photo Proofing\" feature in the Image Gallery?"
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/help.php:51
msgid "Absolutely. By turning on the \"Photo Proofing\" option within the gallery module, you empower clients to choose images for downloading or forwarding them to you for additional edits. To activate this feature, navigate to the \"Permissions\" tab during the gallery module setup and select the \"Photo Proofing\" option."
msgstr ""

