#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:91
msgid ""
"Integrate Google Drive is the best and easy to use Google Drive cloud solution plugin for\n"
"                WordPress to integrate your Google Drive documents and media directly into your WordPress\n"
"                Website."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:98
msgid ""
"Share your Google Drive cloud files into your site very fast and easily. You can browse, manage,\n"
"                embed, display, upload, download, search, play, share your Google Drive files directly into your\n"
"                website without any hassle and coding."
msgstr ""

