"You can manage your cloud files from your website using the full-featured file browser of the\n"
"                    plugin. Manage preview, download, upload, rename, move, delete, permissions per user using\n"
"                    the file browser. Users can also browse your cloud files using the File Browser."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:147
msgid ""
"You and also your users can upload files directly to your Google Drive account from your\n"
"                    site. You can upload unlimited size of files."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:164
msgid ""
"You can play your Google Drive audio & video files with a playlist into your website. Audio and\n"
"                video can be played in a single player."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:180
msgid ""
"You can add a grid lightbox popup gallery of photos and videos in your page/ post using the gallery\n"
"                    module of the plugin. The gallery will be generated based on the folders, photos and images that you select."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:194
