msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:209
msgid ""
"You can search any of your cloud files from your site and also let the users to search the\n"
"                    cloud files to view and download."
msgstr ""

#: includes/views/getting-started/introduction.php:223
msgid ""
"You can easily embed any Google Drive Cloud files in any post/ page of your WordPress website\n"
